---
const freeFeatures = [
  'Manual tracking with the redesigned add-transaction flow',
  '3 budget categories for your highest-priority spending',
  'Smart assistant access with monthly usage limits',
  'Reflections, regret tracking, and local category memory',
];

const premiumFeatures = [
  'Unlimited budgets, reflections, and assistant sessions',
  'Receipt scanning with AI extraction',
  'Multi-currency support and richer preference controls',
  'Priority AI personality tuning and future digest features',
];
---

<section id="pricing" class="py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="section-kicker">Plans</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading mt-6">
        Start with the core conscience. Upgrade when you want the full memory.
      </h2>
      <p class="section-copy mt-6">
        The free plan stays useful and opinionated. Premium expands the number of surfaces where Conscia
        can help, remember, and automate.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr,1.05fr]">
      <article class="feature-panel">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <span class="chip-gold">Free</span>
            <h3 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[var(--ink-strong)]">$0</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
              A focused version for people who want to build a better spending habit before they add more
              automation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
          {freeFeatures.map((feature) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-2 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--angel-deep)]"></span>
              <span>{feature}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <a href="#" class="premium-cta-secondary mt-8 w-full">Download the free app</a>
      </article>

      <article class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] border border-[rgba(23,36,79,0.1)] bg-[linear-gradient(160deg,#17244f_0%,#233676_56%,#162248_100%)] p-8 text-white shadow-[var(--shadow)]">
        <div class="absolute right-8 top-6 rounded-full bg-[rgba(246,203,104,0.18)] px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[var(--gold)]">
          Premium
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-xl">
          <span class="chip-gold bg-[rgba(246,203,104,0.18)] text-[var(--gold)]">Most complete experience</span>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">$4.99<span class="ml-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white/70">/ month</span></h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-white/72">
            For people who want Conscia to be more than a tracker: faster input, more memory, richer
            signals, and more room for the assistant to help.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
          {premiumFeatures.map((feature) => (
            <div class="rounded-[24px] border border-white/10 bg-white/6 p-4">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-1 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--gold)]"></span>
                <span class="text-sm leading-7 text-white/82">{feature}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="#" class="premium-cta rounded-full bg-[var(--gold)] px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-[var(--navy)] hover:brightness-95">
            Start Premium
          </a>
          <a href="#roadmap" class="premium-cta rounded-full border border-white/16 bg-white/6 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10">
            See what is coming next
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
